<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25169" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλογ-ίζομαι</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λελόγισμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Amphis
					33.9
				</span></i>
			:—<i>balance accounts,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					52.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					5.510.10
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				241
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>C</u>
				127
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>calculate exactly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁπόσον . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.
					43.15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Amphis
			</span></i> l.c.; <i>consider,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀεί τι δ. καλόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Democr.
					112
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				6.90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Epit.</u>
				36
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κενὰ δ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				347
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ὑμᾶς αὐτούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Is.
					7.45
				</span></i>
			; <i>stop to consider,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.98
			</span></i>; <i>distinguish between,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ καλὰ καὶ τὰ μή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>debate, argue,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.5.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>impute,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ki.</u>
					19.19(20)
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> c. acc. loci.
				<i>hold a circuit court</i> (Lat. <i>conventus</i>)
			<i>for</i> a district, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				74.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				484.24
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν Ἰονλιοπόλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					903.18
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
